  "description": "For comfort and performance, the All Road's seat can be adjusted between 51 and 58 degrees.\n\nThe All Road's rear suspension features a highly progressive travel path combined with a custom spring rate and sophisticated damping for a perfect balance of performance and comfort. Up front, the All Road uses our patented anti-dive suspension spindles to take the edge off.\n\nThe new Catrike All Road utilizes the legendary full-suspension system pioneered on the Dumont. The All Road's rear suspension features a progressive travel path and a custom spring rate with sophisticated damping. The CNC-machined swingarm pivots on precision cartridge bearings for durability and smooth articulation. Up front, the All Road employs our patented anti-dive front suspension axles, allowing independent movement of all three wheels. The All Road comes outfitted with three, 20-inch wheels wrapped in Schwalbe 2.0 Big Apple tires, a high and wide adjustable seat and a 1x10 MicroShift drivetrain for unmatched comfort and performance.",
